    "body": "It's required to get rid of the following deprecation warning:\r\n\r\n> client.is_stopped is deprecated. Run \":checkhealth vim.deprecated\" for more information\r\n> vim.deprecated:                                                           1 ⚠️\r\n> \r\n>  ~\r\n> - ⚠️ WARNING client.is_stopped is deprecated. Feature will be removed in Nvim 0.13\r\n>   - ADVICE:\r\n>     - use client:is_stopped instead.\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-14T13:46:32Z",
